<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank sees wage rises of 3 pct as reasonable.</title>
<headline>Riksbank sees wage rises of 3 pct as reasonable.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden central bank's deputy governor, Lars Heikensten, on Tuesday said the Riksbank saw wage increases of three percent in the next few years as reasonable.</p>
</text>
